# Local iteration artefacts. `npm pack` output is handed to a consumer by path
# so the PACKAGING BOUNDARY gets tested — npm link and file: deps honour
# `exports` but NOT `files`, so anything missing from `files` resolves locally
# and 404s on publish. Never commit the tarball itself.
*.tgz
